format session-log-v1
stamp 20260820.024612
editor Claude Code
model claude-opus-5
voice Kyri
host Vultr SEA NixOS VPS ai-jail pier (Daylight DC-1 hand) -- Eastern (EDT)
title Caravan reckon -- a plan that lost an arc is reported short, and the run says so
prompt Keaton set the loop running: pick up the running thread from the newest logs, take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, stand fast on reds, send each finished increment.
think The newest log's recommend named this rung outright -- a run that abandons work knows what was lost yet never says whether the plan should have been run at all, so a record that refuses to report itself complete while an arc it absorbed bought nothing is the mirror of the abandon rung. Reading confer, revoke, reclaim, and abandon as a set rather than a list showed why: all four weigh one dependent, and none weighs the plan.
think The gap is exact and it lives in the report rather than the run. abandon.rye writes the abandoned reach into the departed domain's notes and reads it back, so the number is a fact -- and then run_in_answer returns cleanly anyway. The record drained, every outcome matched the word its author declared, the assert says every phase either started a dependent or was absorbed. An operator reads four phases queued, three dependents reaped, one absorbed and concludes the plan was carried out, with the loss sitting beside it as one more counter nobody has to look at.
think So completion becomes a verdict the run earns rather than a shape it happens to have. A plan is carried when every phase it absorbed into a standing dependent was actually served, and short when any was not -- because a drained queue proves every phase was taken up, and taking a phase up is a different act from serving it. The verdict is derived from the work, so the record's tidiness is evidence of nothing on its own.
think Four refusals, each about the plan rather than one dependent. ReckonEarly is the moment, since a verdict taken while a dependent still stands would judge work that may yet be carried. ReckonUnabsorbed is the work this rung weighs, and a plan that absorbed nothing is left carried by the shape of its own record rather than judged by a measurement that does not apply to it. ReckonMiscounted is the honesty of the count. ReckonOverclaimed is the answer -- the hard half -- since a run that read back a verdict of carried while an arc it absorbed bought nothing would report a plan carried out that nobody carried out.
think The verdict stands on the wire for the same reason the abandonment does: a judgment held in a process that has exited is a claim, while one on disk is a fact an operator can read afterward. The plan's note is written after the last dependent is reaped, read back before the report believes it, and read a third time by the witness from outside the run entirely.
think Five RED paths proven on metal before any GREEN was claimed. Drop the moment and a plan is judged while a dependent still stands; drop the work and a plan that absorbed nothing is reckoned all the same; drop the honesty of the count and a plan loses more arcs than it ever absorbed; withhold the verdict from the wire and the run refuses its own record rather than trusting a judgment it never read back; derive the verdict as if nothing were lost and a reckoning run would report its plan carried out, which is the guard catching the same gap from the other side.
think Then the choir found a red of its own. tools/caravan_harvest_witness.rish went RED inside the 55-rung sing and GREEN alone -- the same lantern the previous lap recorded firing once and honestly declined to book. A lantern that fires twice becomes a loom, so this one is measured rather than shrugged at.
obs The measurement is the first in this arc that weighs the report rather than the run. Dark reach, stale reach, inherited reach, and abandoned reach each count arcs a dependent held; overclaimed completion counts a claim a supervisor made. It falls from 1 to 0.
obs Every number stands still across the two runs including the loss itself -- 4 phases, 3 dependents, 1 carried home, 1 arc conferred, 1 conferral reclaimed, 1 phase absorbed, 1 arc abandoned, identical. Only the verdict moves, and that is what makes this a finding about the report rather than about the work. The abandon rung's own finding is what makes this one visible at all.
obs The rung buys no speed and no room, as the four below it did not. It buys the honesty of the account: the arc now answers what a dependent may touch at every moment of its life, what its going cost, and finally whether the plan those dependents served was carried out.
loom witness=caravan_reckon_witness rungs=55 phases=4 dependents=3 absorbed=1 abandoned=1 overclaimed_assuming=1 overclaimed_reckoning=0 red_paths_proven=5
loom red=REDS_%95 witness=caravan_harvest_witness cold_runs=12 red_runs=2 claim=by_readiness.idle_by_order==0
obs REDS %95 is booked open and named as the next lap's crux. The harvest rung's stagger lap asserts an exact zero over a measurement the scheduler gets a vote in, and 2 of 12 cold runs disagree with it. The close waits on a diagnosis rather than a softened assert -- weakening the guard without understanding why a readiness turn stands idle would be routing around it, and the exact-zero form is also stronger than the finding it defends, which is a claim about direction.
obs The council rota read this lap was item 10, Sameness Is the Macro. Its argument is the shape of this whole arc read from outside: fifty-five rungs compress because they are publicly similar -- the same wrapped report, the same four-refusal grammar, the same two-run measurement, the same generalization test -- so learning one rung is learning all of them, and none of that compression is a private dialect.
file caravan/reckon.rye the rung -- the verdict fold, the plan-level note, and the run that reckons its own record before reporting it
file tools/caravan_reckon_witness.rish the witness -- two ledgers over one plan, the verdict read from the wire outside the run, five RED paths named
file tools/caravan_suite_witness.rish registers the new rung; the choir stands at 55 with its bijection whole
file caravan/README.md the durable per-rung prose, where the card's live edge will fold when it ages
file crux/REDS.md REDS %95 booked open -- the harvest rung green by a coin flip, measured 2 of 12
file crux/REMEMBER.md the live edge refreshed, the open red named, the reclaim bullet folded to the pointer
file crux/CAIRNS.md the walk-back for that fold, at nib 05311de906
recommend keep-going the next lap is REDS %95 rather than a new rung -- reds first, and this one is agent-closable: measure why a readiness turn stands idle at all on the stagger lap, then choose between a deterministic lap and a claim shaped like the finding, since a witness that fails a correct tree teaches a bench to re-run rather than to read.
